extends /specs/products/pericles/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade

block content

    section.source_section
        h2 Access variations

        h3 Full Access
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `full-access` to the link item.
        .source_example
            .doi-access-wrapper
                .access-type.full-access
                    i(aria-hidden='true' class='icon-icon-lock_open')
                    div.doi-access
                        | Full access

        h3 Open Access
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `open-access` to the link item.
        .source_example
            .doi-access-wrapper
                .access-type.open-access
                    i(aria-hidden='true' class='icon-icon-lock_open')
                    div.doi-access
                        | Open access

        h3 Free Access
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `free-access` to the link item.
        .source_example
            .doi-access-wrapper
                .access-type.free-access
                    i(aria-hidden='true' class='icon-icon-lock_open')
                    div.doi-access
                        | Free access
        h3 Free Access
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `no-access` to the link item.
            small note: we are no longer show the no access based on `LIT-193525`
        .source_example
            .doi-access-wrapper
                .access-type.no-access
                    i(aria-hidden='true' class='icon-icon-lock_outline')
                    div.doi-access
                        | No access

        h3 Free Access
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `limited-access` to the link item.
        .source_example
            .doi-access-wrapper
                .access-type.limited-access
                    i(aria-hidden='true' class='icon-icon-lock_outline')
                    div.doi-access
                        | limited access

        h3 Highlight
        markdown
            p In the example below we have added `badge-oa` to the link item.
        .source_example
            .highlight-wrapper
                i(aria-hidden='true' class='icon-icon-bookmark')
                div.highlight
                    | Highlight
    | #{''}
